nt que je tente de faire ressortir.","en":"That's the point I'm trying to make.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"argument"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"tent"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to do"},null]},{"text":"Tu n'en ressors que ce que tu y as mis.","en":"You get out only what you put in.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"that / what"},null,null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"what"]]},{"text":"Voyons ce qui en ressort.","en":"Let's see what the outcome is.","words":[{"g":"really!"},null,null,{"g":"in / of it"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"what (that which"]]},{"text":"Nous verrons ce qu'il en ressort.","en":"We'll see what comes of it.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]}]}